    "body": "Self-review pass 1 ΓÇö fixed in ed38484:\n\n1. **storage/lock.ts** ΓÇö handle-leak path on the lock file when `fh.close()` (or any non-EEXIST exception between open and the fn-wrapping try/finally) failed. The lock file was left on disk and the handle wasn't released. Now tracks the handle and runs `releaseIfMine` on the failure path.\n2. **workspace/fs-workspace-repository.ts** ΓÇö `list()` could be killed by a single corrupted `workspace.json` because `tryHydrate` threw. `list()` now isolates per-entry corruption and drops the bad entry; `read(id)` still propagates the typed error. Regression test added.\n\n194 catalog tests / 31 workspace tests / 13 storage tests / 128 server tests, all green; lint clean.",
