    "body": "Self-review pass 2 ΓÇö fixed in 7982aa9:\n\n* **storage/json.ts** ΓÇö `readJson` was unbounded; a malformed gigabyte-scale `workspace.json` would OOM the process. Added `maxBytes` option (default 10 MB) and `JsonFileTooLargeError`. Stats first, then reads through a held handle to defeat concurrent-writer races. Test added.\n\nPass 2 also flagged a low-severity test gap (InMemory vs Fs ENOENT message parity on `installFromDir`); not fixing ΓÇö code matching uses `.code`, not `.message`, in every consumer.\n\nCounts: storage 14 / workspace 31 / catalog 194 / runtime 114 / terminal 33 / session 60 / task 84 / server 128 ΓÇö all green; lint clean.",
