    "body": "Self-review pass 3 ΓÇö fixed in 81c75d8 (+ cleanup 3e76207):\n\n* **storage/json.ts** ΓÇö pre-read `stat()` size guard had a TOCTOU window: a concurrent writer growing the file between stat and `fh.readFile()` would bypass the cap (FileHandle.readFile honors current on-disk bytes, not the stat snapshot). Added a post-read `buf.length > maxBytes` check; the pre-read stat is kept as a cheap fast-path so we never even open obviously-huge files. Test added.\n* Removed a `test-race-file.json` artifact the review agent left in the repo root.\n\nCounts: storage 15 / workspace 31 / catalog 194 / runtime 114 / terminal 33 / session 60 / task 84 / server 128 ΓÇö all green; lint clean.",
